-- One refusal, used at two types. REFUSE is an expression at ANY type, so a
-- single polymorphic placeholder serves a NUMBER-valued rule and a
-- BOOLEAN-valued one without being written twice.
--
-- (Deliberately no #CHECK here: a #CHECK on a polymorphic definition prints an
-- inference-variable gensym, whose name moves with unrelated changes and would
-- make this file's golden unstable.)

IMPORT prelude

GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`this rule has not been written yet` MEANS
    REFUSE "this rule has not been written yet"

GIVETH A NUMBER
`the amount` MEANS 1 PLUS `this rule has not been written yet`

GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`is eligible` MEANS TRUE AND `this rule has not been written yet`

#ASSERT REFUSED `the amount`
#ASSERT REFUSED `is eligible`
#ASSERT REFUSED `the amount` BECAUSE "this rule has not been written yet"
